     '70% cotton / 28% nylon / 2% elastane', 'Soft combed cotton'),
    ('classic-thermal-crew-women', 'Soft Thermal Crew', 'WOMEN', 'thermal', 'crew', 'Winter',
     'Brushed, thick and soft, in one colour. For the cold walk to the bazaar and the evening at home.',
